    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "APRIL 24, 1955\nTRANS -\nCANADA\nAir Lines\nU.S. EDITION\nFly\nTCA\nTHE MAPLE LEAF ROUTE\nNow, TCA flies on\nyour LOCAL TIME!\nSEE PAGE FOUR FOR DETAILS\nTRANSCONTINENTAL\nINTERNATIONAL\nTRANS-ATLANTIC\nBERMUDA-CARIBBEAN",
      "CONNECTIONS AT VAI\nAUSTRALIA AND\nICOUVER WITH CPAL AND. QEA FOR HONOLULU,\nZEALAND;\nAND\nWITH CPAL FOR THE ORIENT.\nTCA\nTrans-Canada Air Lines -\nMore Than Ever Before - One of the World's Great Airlines\nCHICAGO-TORONTO..\nCLEVELAND-TORONTO\nDETROIT/WINDSOR-TORONTO.\nNEW YORK-TORONTO..\nNEW YORK-MONTREAL\nTAMPA-TORONTO.\nTAMPA-KINGSTON.\nSEATTLE/TACOMA-VICTORIA\nBOSTON-HALIFAX.\nTCA MILEAGES\n449\nMEXICO—TORONTO..\n196\nMONTREAL—PARIS..\n199\n381\nMONTREAL-HALIFAX.\nTORONTO-WINNIPEG.\n357\nWINNIPEG-CALGARY\n. 1127\nCALGARY-VANCOUVER.\n104\nBERMUDA-BARBADOS...\n491\nBARBADOS-PORT OF SPAIN\n, 2340\n3614\n538\nLegend\nTCA SERVICES\nOTHER AIRLINES\n956\n748\nTIME ZONES\n471\n1367\n212\nEASTERN TIME\nATLANTIC TIME\nPACIFIC TIME\nPST\nMOUNTAIN TIME\nMST\nCENTRAL TIME\nNEWFOUNDLAND\nTIME\nGREENWICH\nTIME\nEST\nAST\nCST\nGMT\n1 GOOSE BAY\nALBERTA\nEDMONTON\nA\nTO EUROPE\nB.C\nRocky\nMountais\nSASK.\nSASKATOON\nMANITOBA,\nCALGARY\n_REGINA-\n- LETHBRIDGE\nVANCOUVER\nVICTORIA\nSEATTLE\nTACOMA\nPORTLAND\nMINNEAPOLIC.\nST PA\nSALT LAKE CITY.\nONTARIO\nQUEBEC\nWINNIPEGFT. WİLLIAM KAPUSKASING\nLaurentians\nPT. ARTHUR\nPORQUIS\n• TIMMINS\nMONTREAL\nSUDBURY\nNORTH BAY\nSAULT STE. MARIE\nMONCTON\n- N..\nSAINT JOHN\n- MUSKOKA®\nOTTAWA\nTORONTO\nLONDON\nDETROIT-\n• HAMILTON\nI BOSTON\nWINDSOR\nCHICAGO\nLCLEVELAND\nNEW YORK\nCO LUM BUS\nDAYTON\nCINCINNAT\nPITTSBURGH\nWASHINGTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nGANDER\nSTEPHENVIBLE\nSYDNEY\nVE WOUNDLAND\n•ST. JOHN'S\n• HALIFAX\nNOVA SCOTIA\nYARMOUTH\nBERMUDA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nKANSAS CITY\nST. LOUIS\nTULSA\nLOS ANGETES-\nSAN DIEGO\nA\nDALLAS\nFORT WORTH\nTAMPA-\nST. PETERSBURG\n• NASSAU\nNEW ORLEANS\nTO BARBADOS\nAND TRINIDAD\nMajor U.S. airlines make connections\nwith TCA at Boston, New York,\nCleveland, Windsor/Detroit, Chicago,\nSeattle and Tampa/St. Petersburg\nKINGSTON\nTO ALL MAJOR CANADIAN CITIES\nAND EUROPE\nMEXICO\nTO SOUTH AMERICA\nTCA\nTCA Serves over 50 Communities throughout 22,000 Route Miles"
